## Slide 2 — Problem Definition

- WHY MULTITRACK EDITING IS CHALLENGING
- Separate files
- Several camera and microphone recordings to organize.
- Misaligned starts
- Recordings may begin at different moments.
- Manual workload
- Camera switching, audio mixing and cutting take time.
- The challenge: turning independent recordings into one coherent episode.

---

## Slide 3 — Proposed Solution

- ONE FOCUSED DESKTOP APPLICATION
- IMPORT
- Audio + video files
- ALIGN
- Shared timeline
- EDIT
- Cuts, video choice, audio mix
- EXPORT
- Finished episode
- Planned functionality — not an implemented product yet.

